, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 2}], "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [5], "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "<strong>Write your own pseudocode.</strong>", "type": "text"}, {"content": " <p><em>Instructions:</em><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\n<ul>\n<span class=\"bullet\"><em>Think of a simple program you would like to create. </em><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\"><em>Set the objectives and steps that your program will have.</em><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\"><em>Write the instructions of your program in a pseudocode. </em><br/>\n<span class=\"bullet\"><em>Take into account the suggestions that the video gives you to write your pseudocode. </em><br/>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>When you have typed in ALL your answers, click the Go to Writing Task button.</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><strong>My Pseudocode</strong></em></p>", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "<p>It&rsquo;s time to review your pseudocode.</p>\n<p>When you are writing your pseudocode, remember to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Use short sentences.</li>\n<li>Capitalize key words.</li>\n<li>Indent statements.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Proofread your pseudocode for any spelling, grammar or punctuation errors.</p>\n<p>Read your text aloud to a partner.</p>\n<p>Click the <strong>Submit </strong>button to save your work.</p>\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "colspan": 1}, {"content_type": "text", "content": "", "element": "th", "cols